---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { getContactLinks } from "../lib/site-content";

const contact = await getContactLinks();
const EFFECTIVE_DATE = "23 September 2026";
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Cookie Policy — Sunflora"
  description="What cookies and browser storage Sunflora uses, and how to control your preferences."
  effectiveDate={EFFECTIVE_DATE}
>
  <Fragment slot="title">Cookie Policy</Fragment>

  <p>
    This policy explains the cookies and similar browser storage technologies
    used on sunfloracrochet.in, and how you can control them. It should be
    read alongside our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>1. What "cookies" means here</h2>
  <p>
    We use the term "cookies" broadly, to cover actual browser cookies as
    well as similar technologies such as <code>localStorage</code>, which
    some parts of the Site use instead of a cookie for the same purpose.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Categories we use</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Category</th>
        <th>Purpose</th>
        <th>Consent needed?</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Strictly necessary</strong></td>
        <td>
          Keeps your cart contents (stored in your browser's
          <code>localStorage</code>) and your sign-in session working. The
          Site cannot function without these.
        </td>
        <td>No — always on</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Analytics</strong></td>
        <td>
          Helps us understand which pages and products are visited, so we
          can improve the shop. Not currently active on the Site.
        </td>
        <td>Yes — off until you accept</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Marketing</strong></td>
        <td>
          Used for social or ad retargeting (e.g. Instagram/Meta). Not
          currently active on the Site.
        </td>
        <td>Yes — off until you accept</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>3. What's active right now</h2>
  <p>
    At the effective date above, Sunflora does not run any analytics or
    advertising cookies — only the strictly necessary cart and sign-in
    storage described above is in use. If we add analytics or marketing
    tools in future (for example, to see which products are popular), they
    will only load after you accept that category in the cookie banner or
    preference centre, and this page will be updated to name them.
  </p>
  <p>
    Note that our payment gateway, Razorpay, may set its own cookies while
    you're completing a payment, in order to process your transaction
    securely. These are set and controlled by Razorpay, not Sunflora — see
    Razorpay's own privacy and cookie disclosures for details.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Managing your preferences</h2>
  <p>
    You can change your cookie choices at any time using the
    <button type="button" data-open-cookie-preferences class="legal-inline-link">
      "Cookie preferences"
    </button>
    link in the site footer, or by clearing your browser's site data for
    sunfloracrochet.in. You can also control or block cookies generally
    through your browser's settings, though doing so may affect how well
    the cart and sign-in work.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Questions</h2>
  <p>
    If you have questions about this Cookie Policy, contact us at
    <a href={contact.mailto}>{contact.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <hr />
  <p>
    See also our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> and
    <a href="/terms-and-conditions">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>

<style>
  .legal-inline-link {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    font: inherit;
    color: var(--kn-rose);
    text-decoration: underline;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
</style>
